abstract: >
  Code, data, and preprint accompanying the analysis of
  arithmetic regularities in the standard genetic code.
  The work studies nucleon-count quantities (P, N, T)
  across codon groups defined by the Rumer partition and
  by third-position chemical axes, extending prior results
  of Shcherbak-Makukov (2013) and Panov-Filatov (2024).
  The repository contains the preprint (LaTeX source and
  PDF), input and computed datasets, a reproducibility
  script, and an interactive HTML visualizer.
keywords:
  - genetic code
  - amino acids
  - nucleon composition
  - Rumer partition
  - arithmetic regularities
  - divisibility by 37
